OL,3,GNEWSALorry-mounted crane topples over
OL,4,Ain car park
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne person was taken to hospital as a
OL,7,Fprecaution after a lorry-mounted crane
OL,8,Ftoppled over in an apartment complex's
OL,9,Fcar park.
OL,11,FEmergency services attended the West
OL,12,FPark Apartments in St Helier and two
OL,13,Fpeople were in the vehicle at the time
OL,14,Fof the incident on Tuesday morning.
OL,16,FThe fire service said St Aubin's Road
OL,17,Fwas closed because of the risk of
OL,18,Fdiesel reaching the road.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
