OL,3,GNEWSALorry-mounted crane topples over
OL,4,Ain car park
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt has asked people to avoid the area
OL,7,Fand follow diversion routes while
OL,8,Femergency services and recovery teams
OL,9,Fdeal with the incident.
